      "text": "Canonical topology: serve/kanban/src/owlbear_kanban/topology.py\nDispatch ranks: collect, verify, build, shape; priorities high, medium, low\nMCP facade: serve/mcp-kanban exposes list/show/create/edit/move/start/end/pick\nStorage: .owlbear/kanban/tasks/*.md and .owlbear/kanban/archive/*.md",
